    <skt>badzra gu h+ya mahA kA ya rad+na b+ha le a kra ma su tra</skt>
    <coloph>de la zhu ba po dga' rab rdo rjes zhus te/ sdud pa po rdo rje chos kyis bsdud nas/ rin po che za ma tog mtshon gang ba'i nang du sbas nas/ 'gul khug tu bcug nas/ nyid kyi thugs dam rtse gcig par mdzado/ /rgyud lung man ngag grangs mang yang/ /bstan pa'i snying po yi ge lnga/ /thugs kyi gter du bcas pa yin/ /gcig las gnyisu ma spel gcig/ ces bka' sdigso/ na ra kan/ 'jam dpal rdo rje ye shes ngas/ /shri sing ha khyod la gtad/ /phyag rgya lnga yi dbyingsu sbas/ /rdo rje 'chang gis rgya yis btab/ / mkha'gro lnga yis mdud pa bkrol/ /'jam dpal rdo rje chos kyi 'gul khug ma/ /snod du mi sba rang gi lus la bcangs/ /yid la dran pa tsam gyis 'bras bu sngon sangs rgyas/ /chu srin pir gyi gre ba bzhin// srid pa 'khrugs kyang kha mi 'byung/ /bya brtsal med pa gsang ba rin po che dbyig gi sgron ma/ skad 'gyur bzhi pa rdzogso</coloph>
